# Proper names of bright stars, as approved by the IAU Working Group on Star Names (WGSN).
# Format:  Name | designation   (designation syntax as in constellations.src, with the
# constellation always spelled out: "Alp CMa", "Alp1 Cru", "80 UMa", or "#2491" for an HR number).
# gen_assets.py resolves each to an HR number and writes app/src/main/assets/star_names.txt.
